vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:5200
}

docs {
  Updates a program and replaces its full structure (course units + fee structures) in one request (multipart/form-data).
  Existing course units, fee headers, and fee lines are soft-deleted; new ones are created from the request.
  Existing program stream is soft-deleted and replaced if a streamGuid is provided.
  An optional accLetterFile can be attached as a file part named accLetterFile.
  
  ProgramUnits fields: SemCode (int, 1-based), CourseUnitGuid, StreamGuid (optional), UnitTypeGuid, UnitCatGuid, Flag (1=Core, 2=Elective).
  FeeStructures fields: FeeCode, FeeDesc, Status, LocalOrForeign, CalcType, AmtPer, Lef, Cef, Ace, Lec, Cec, Acec, IntakeGuid, FeeLines[].
  FeeLines fields: SemCode, LedgerGuid, CurrencyGuid, LedgerNum, Amount.
  
  Success (200): data is the updated program object.
  Failures: 400 duplicate_program_code / invalid_sem_code / duplicate_program_unit / duplicate_fee_code / stream_not_mapped; 404 not_found if any referenced GUID does not exist.
}
